# Repo-wide build artifacts. The per-SDK .gitignore files still stand and are
# the specific ones (c/magicseam names its own .a, zig/magicseam its zig-out);
# this file carries only what EVERY language tree here can produce, so a new SDK
# under a new directory is covered before anyone remembers to add its own.
#
# rust/perseid had no .gitignore at all until the extraction - it inherited
# nothing, because in the monorepo nothing above it needed to say `target/`.

# Rust
target/

# Go - the module lives at go/, but binaries can land anywhere
*.test
*.out

# TypeScript
node_modules/

# Zig
.zig-cache/
zig-out/

# C
*.o
*.a
